second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which league does Aldo Hudson play in?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 74, \"text\": \"Here is a narrative that weaves in detailed evidence to support the claim:\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 76, \"end\": 189, \"text\": \"It was a chilly winter evening in 1998 when Aldo Hudson stepped onto the court at Troy University's Trojan Arena.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 190, \"end\": 336, \"text\": \"The crowd was electric, and the energy was palpable as the Trojans prepared to take on their arch-rivals, the University of South Alabama Jaguars.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 337, \"end\": 476, \"text\": \"As a freshman guard, Aldo was about to make his debut in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league, and he was ready to make a statement.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 477, \"end\": 611, \"text\": \"As the game tipped off, Aldo's quick reflexes and lightning-fast drives to the basket left the Jaguars' defense scrambling to keep up.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 612, \"end\": 730, \"text\": \"His impressive performance that night, which included 17 points and 5 assists, was just a glimpse of what was to come.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 731, \"end\": 888, \"text\": \"Over the course of the 1998-1999 season, Aldo would go on to establish himself as a force to be reckoned with in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 889, \"end\": 974, \"text\": \"But what exactly does it mean to play in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league?\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 975, \"end\": 1059, \"text\": \"For starters, it means competing against the best of the best in college basketball.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1060, \"end\": 1236, \"text\": \"The NCAA, or National Collegiate Athletic Association, is the governing body for college athletics in the United States, and its Division I is the highest level of competition.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1237, \"end\": 1453, \"text\": \"To be eligible to play in the NCAA Division I, a university must meet strict criteria, including a minimum number of athletic scholarships, a certain level of athletic budget, and a commitment to academic excellence.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1454, \"end\": 1553, \"text\": \"Troy University, where Aldo played, is a member of the NCAA Division I and the Sun Belt Conference.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1554, \"end\": 1718, \"text\": \"As a Division I school, Troy is required to adhere to the NCAA's strict rules and regulations, including those related to recruiting, eligibility, and athletic aid.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1719, \"end\": 1913, \"text\": \"This means that Aldo, as a student-athlete at Troy, was subject to rigorous academic standards, including maintaining a minimum GPA and completing a certain number of credit hours each semester.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1914, \"end\": 2088, \"text\": \"Throughout the 1998-1999 season, Aldo's impressive stats and clutch performances earned him recognition not only from his coaches and teammates but also from the NCAA itself.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2089, \"end\": 2205, \"text\": \"He was named to the Sun Belt Conference All-Freshman Team, a testament to his hard work and dedication to the sport.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2206, \"end\": 2278, \"text\": \"But Aldo's success on the court was not limited to individual accolades.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 181, \"text\": \"As the sun dipped below the horizon, casting a warm orange glow over the campus of Troy University, Aldo Hudson laced up her sneakers and made her way to the Sartain Hall Gymnasium.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 182, \"end\": 364, \"text\": \"It was a crisp autumn evening in 1998, and the air was alive with the hum of excitement as the Trojans prepared to take on their arch-rivals, the University of South Alabama Jaguars.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 365, \"end\": 506, \"text\": \"Aldo, a junior point guard with a lightning-quick first step and a penchant for clutch three-pointers, was the undisputed leader of the team.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 507, \"end\": 647, \"text\": \"Her coach, the wise and witty Karen Townsend, had often praised Aldo's exceptional court vision and ability to read the defense like a book.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 648, \"end\": 797, \"text\": \"As Aldo took the court for warm-ups, she was greeted by the familiar sight of her teammates, each one a unique and vital cog in the Trojans' machine.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 798, \"end\": 1009, \"text\": \"There was Rachel, the towering center with a soft touch and a mean streak; Jasmine, the speedy shooting guard with a flair for the dramatic; and Emily, the steady-handed power forward with a nose for rebounding.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1010, \"end\": 1142, \"text\": \"Together, they formed a formidable unit, one that had been making waves in the NCAA Division I women's basketball league all season.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1143, \"end\": 1240, \"text\": \"Aldo, in particular, had been turning heads with her impressive stats and fearless playing style.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1241, \"end\": 1336, \"text\": \"She was the kind of player who could take over a game at any moment, and her opponents knew it.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1337, \"end\": 1476, \"text\": \"As the crowd began to file in, Aldo caught a glimpse of her family in the stands – her mom, dad, and little sister, all beaming with pride.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1477, \"end\": 1604, \"text\": \"They had driven down from Montgomery just to see her play, and Aldo was determined to give them a show they would never forget.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1605, \"end\": 1670, \"text\": \"The referee's whistle pierced the air, and the game was underway.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1671, \"end\": 1799, \"text\": \"Aldo sprinted down the court, her ponytail bouncing behind her, as the Trojans launched into their signature fast-paced offense.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1800, \"end\": 1862, \"text\": \"The Jaguars were tough opponents, but Aldo was ready for them.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1863, \"end\": 1948, \"text\": \"She had spent countless hours in the gym, honing her skills and perfecting her craft.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1949, \"end\": 1998, \"text\": \"As the clock ticked down, Aldo's confidence grew.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1999, \"end\": 2128, \"text\": \"She was in her element, surrounded by her teammates and the electric atmosphere of the NCAA Division I women's basketball league.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Aldo Hudson\", \"scope\": \"League\", \"claim\": \"Aldo Hudson played in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league.\", \"answer\": \"NCAA Division I men's basketball league\", \"quote\": \"As a freshman guard, Aldo was about to make his debut in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league, and he was ready to make a statement. As the game tipped off, Aldo's quick reflexes and lightning-fast drives to the basket left the Jaguars' defense scrambling to keep up. His impressive performance that night, which included 17 points and 5 assists, was just a glimpse of what was to come. Over the course of the 1998-1999 season, Aldo would go on to establish himself as a force to be reckoned with in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Aldo Hudson\", \"scope\": \"League\", \"claim\": \"Aldo Hudson plays in the NCAA Division I women's basketball league.\", \"answer\": \"NCAA Division I women's basketball league\", \"quote\": \"Together, they formed a formidable unit, one that had been making waves in the NCAA Division I women's basketball league all season. Aldo, in particular, had been turning heads with her impressive stats and fearless playing style. She was the kind of player who could take over a game at any moment, and her opponents knew it. As the crowd began to file in, Aldo caught a glimpse of her family in the stands – her mom, dad, and little sister, all beaming with pride. They had driven down from Montgomery just to see her play, and Aldo was determined to give them a show they would never forget. The referee's whistle pierced the air, and the game was underway. Aldo sprinted down the court, her ponytail bouncing behind her, as the Trojans launched into their signature fast-paced offense. The Jaguars were tough opponents, but Aldo was ready for them. She had spent countless hours in the gym, honing her skills and perfecting her craft. As the clock ticked down, Aldo's confidence grew. She was in her element, surrounded by her teammates and the electric atmosphere of the NCAA Division I women's basketball league.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"NCAA Division I men's basketball league\", \"NCAA Division I women's basketball league\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"NCAA Division I men's basketball league\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"NCAA Division I women's basketball league\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
